<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Notas - App Segura v2 (Fase 2)</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --surface: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
            --surface-alt: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
            --accent: #34d399;
            --accent-strong: #10b981;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            --danger: #f87171;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12), transparent 28%),
                        linear-gradient(180deg, #020617 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .page {
            width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
        }

        header .intro {
            flex: 1 1 420px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
        }

        header p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .actions a {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 160px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.18);
            color: #f8c3c3;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 24px;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .panel {
            padding: 26px;
            background: var(--surface-alt);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
        }

        .panel h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .panel form {
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .panel input[type="text"],
        .panel textarea,
        .panel input[type="file"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .panel input[type="file"] {
            color: var(--text);
            padding: 10px 12px;
        }

        .panel button {
            width: fit-content;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-strong));
            color: #04120c;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .panel .note {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            min-width: 680px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 16px 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
            color: var(--text);
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-strong);
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        a.file-link {
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a.file-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .actions-inline button {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.14);
            color: #f8c3c3;
            border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.28);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .actions-inline button:hover {
            background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.24);
        }

        .bottom-note {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            header { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
            .actions { align-items: stretch; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="intro">
                <h1>Bienvenido, <span id="sessionUser">...</span></h1>
                <p>Notas aisladas por usuario (sin IDOR), subida de archivos con whitelist de tipo/tamaño y sesión vía JWT en cookie httpOnly.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions">
                <a href="#" id="logoutLink">Cerrar sesión</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="panel">
                <h2>Crear nota</h2>
                <form id="noteForm">
                    <input id="title" type="text" placeholder="Título" required>
                    <textarea id="content" placeholder="Contenido" rows="3"></textarea>
                    <input id="file" type="file">
                    <button type="submit">Crear</button>
                </form>
                <p class="note">Tipos permitidos: PNG, JPG, GIF, PDF, TXT. El nombre del archivo lo genera el servidor (sin path traversal).</p>
            </div>

            <div class="panel">
                <h2>Resumen de seguridad (fase 2)</h2>
                <p class="note">SQLi bloqueada (consultas preparadas), contraseñas con bcrypt, rate limit en login,
                whitelist de subida, descarga de archivos con verificación de dueño, cabeceras Helmet/CSP y
                errores sin stack trace.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
            <h2>Mis notas</h2>
            <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <th>ID</th>
                        <th>Título</th>
                        <th>Contenido</th>
                        <th>Archivo</th>
                        <th>Acciones</th>
                    </tr>
                    <tbody id="notesBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bottom-note">
            Prueba de IDOR corregida: <code>/api/files/&lt;id&gt;</code> solo responde si el archivo pertenece a tu
            sesión; con otro usuario o sin cookie da 401/403, a diferencia de fase1.
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/js/notes.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
